source: crates/socketchat-tui/tests/screens.rs
expression: "render_marked(&app, &vm, 80, 24)"
---
┌ Chats ───────────┐┌ Socketchat ──────────────────────────┐┌ People ──────────┐
│#┌ Commands ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐ │
│@│/about                see the version and what Socketchat is              │ │
│#│/admin <name>         make someone an admin (admins)                      │ │
│ │/cancel <number>      stop an invite link from /invites                   │ │
│ │/clear                delete this room's messages from this computer      │ │
│ │/close                close this room for everyone (admins agree)         │ │
│ │/details              see this room's admins, size and age                │ │
│ │/dm <name>            start a two-person chat with someone in this chat   │ │
│ │/forget <number>      delete a server and its rooms from this computer    │ │
│ │/help                 see every command and what it does                  │ │
│ │/invite               make a one-time link that brings someone into this  │ │
│ │                      chat                                                │ │
│ │/invite <name>        invite someone you share a room with to this room   │ │
│ │/invite --dm          make a link that opens a new two-person chat        │ │
│ │/invites              see your open invite links                          │ │
│ │/join <link or room>  use a link, or join a room you were invited to      │ │
│ │/join <number>        pick one of several rooms you were invited to       │ │ ◀
│ │/keep                 say no to closing this room (admins)                │ │
└─│/kick <name>          remove someone (admins)                             │─┘
┌─│/leave                leave this chat and delete its history here         │─┐
│ │↓ more                                                                    │ │
└─└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────[ Close ]─┘─┘
Up/Down pick a command · Enter use it · Esc close               socketchat 0.6.1
